Slint Tutorials

A Rust course that builds a small notes editor with Slint
(https://slint.dev/), inspired by Raven Tutorials.

This project uses the GPL-3.0-only option of Slint's licensing. Slint is
available under GPL-3.0-only or under the Slint Royalty-free license; the
application code in this repository, and any binary built from it, is
distributed under GPL-3.0-only. See LICENSE.

Slint itself is not vendored: it is fetched from crates.io as a normal Cargo
dependency. No Raven source or library is included, and Raven is not a
dependency of this course.
